{"2659730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Solo Flight", "steam_appid": 2659730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a pilot tasked with completing missions based around a remote island.  Fly through ring courses with the Cessna 192 Skyhawk, perform reconnaissance missions with the Douglas DC-5 and engage in combat with enemy turrets, drones and jets using the F-16 Falcon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the control of each to achieve aircraft and mission type to achieve the fastest possible time and the best grade. Highly recommended to be played using the Xbox controller (more controller support coming soon), or using the keyboard.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a pilot tasked with completing missions based around a remote island.  Fly through ring courses with the Cessna 192 Skyhawk, perform reconnaissance missions with the Douglas DC-5 and engage in combat with enemy turrets, drones and jets using the F-16 Falcon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the control of each to achieve aircraft and mission type to achieve the fastest possible time and the best grade. Highly recommended to be played using the Xbox controller (more controller support coming soon), or using the keyboard.</p>", "short_description": "Master 24 island missions in three iconic planes and three unique mission types for each. Use a controller for the best experience and aim for the top grade.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659730/4e2df29b329e554409e4aadd274d7610ffeccbcf/header.jpg?t=1770290628", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659730/46cd70bbc81940406257331dc480e9fc61bb6e71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770290628", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor